<p id="A3.SS1.p1.5" class="ltx_p">In view of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma5" title="Lemma 5. ‣ Appendix F Technical lemmas ‣ Towards Efficient Online Exploration for Reinforcement Learning with Human Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we have</p>
